        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "6e0b3577-1afc-3a0b-87b2-4bb225a35e5e",
                "word": "initialement",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4bf7b25b-d9b7-3c89-9b97-f5bf7a9a3c94",
                        "entry_id": "6e0b3577-1afc-3a0b-87b2-4bb225a35e5e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "En initiale, au commencement."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4ba3ddb8-27e4-4d4f-ac81-910e692d1e50",
                                "sense_id": "4bf7b25b-d9b7-3c89-9b97-f5bf7a9a3c94",
                                "text": "Puis, le fandom de Tolkien s’est développé dans les années 60, à la faveur d’une réédition en poche du Seigneur des anneaux et « grâce au mouvement hippie », qui voit dans le roman initialement paru en trois volumes en 1954 et 1955 « un discours écologique et humaniste », résume Vivien Lejeune."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "954ff8ed-8a4d-4c6d-abcf-09361b18e1b4",
                                "sense_id": "4bf7b25b-d9b7-3c89-9b97-f5bf7a9a3c94",
                                "text": "Il y a initialement une demande excédentaire de monnaie parce que l'accroissement de la production accroît le besoin de monnaie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb4ef1d3-b855-49d9-9ec0-2e3362493442",
                                "sense_id": "4bf7b25b-d9b7-3c89-9b97-f5bf7a9a3c94",
                                "text": "Initialement, Joseph Terhec ne devait disputer que la compétition par équipes des championnats du monde de judo de Tachkent (Ouzbékistan), qui commencent jeudi."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4354d2d6-1955-4ac5-a21c-4b58e9a5ef0d",
                        "source_entry_id": "6e0b3577-1afc-3a0b-87b2-4bb225a35e5e",
                        "source_sense_id": "4bf7b25b-d9b7-3c89-9b97-f5bf7a9a3c94",
                        "target_lang_word": "zunächst",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "zunächst",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a1c44a2-3c7a-3005-99a3-8d2fb0cf0e2e",
                                        "entry_id": "5a85649e-8a73-3d1a-b4bc-1b0f425d89c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "vor einer zeitlichen oder abstrakten Reihenfolge"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fabb1851-b433-4fed-be37-b58e26b973fb",
                                                "sense_id": "9a1c44a2-3c7a-3005-99a3-8d2fb0cf0e2e",
                                                "text": "Behandeln wir zunächst die Symptome des Problems, später dessen Ursache."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "553cc720-1fda-454b-89a3-12e8259fd5b2",
                                                "sense_id": "9a1c44a2-3c7a-3005-99a3-8d2fb0cf0e2e",
                                                "text": "„Deshalb hatte Rom mit den üblichen Strafexpeditionen zunächst weiterhin Erfolg.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57aec5d0-9d1a-433c-aac6-2eba889f17d5",
                                                "sense_id": "9a1c44a2-3c7a-3005-99a3-8d2fb0cf0e2e",
                                                "text": "„Das etwa 3,6 Meter lange Fluggerät war zunächst von einem B-52-Bomber in einer Flughöhe von knapp 12200 Meter abgesetzt und dann von einer Rakete auf 30000 Meter Höhe gebracht worden.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "18c6d1a6-7dfb-3892-886a-c41942244372",
                                        "entry_id": "5a85649e-8a73-3d1a-b4bc-1b0f425d89c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "am Anfang, zu Beginn"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70f323c4-9465-463f-85bc-18579262d134",
                                                "sense_id": "18c6d1a6-7dfb-3892-886a-c41942244372",
                                                "text": "Bevor ihr ins Kino geht, besucht doch zunächst den Tierpark."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "41c9d5ad-91f7-317e-82c5-fd4d37c9bd5a",
                                        "entry_id": "5a85649e-8a73-3d1a-b4bc-1b0f425d89c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "räumlich benachbart"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c0e248e-b38e-4081-a692-1d1ee726a366",
                                                "sense_id": "41c9d5ad-91f7-317e-82c5-fd4d37c9bd5a",
                                                "text": "Fährt man mit der Eisenbahn von Berlin nach Dresden, kommt man zunächst nach Radebeul."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "zunächst",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d9acab52-3859-3605-bb42-75b7c17a52f5",
                                        "entry_id": "bcc0ea96-4168-3a1c-ac91-5f5f87a925dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "direkt neben, nahe bei, in der Nähe von"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "literary"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86aae024-1d6a-4714-9574-07407a5a2759",
                                                "sense_id": "d9acab52-3859-3605-bb42-75b7c17a52f5",
                                                "text": "Zunächst der Staatsoper befinden sich viele ausgezeichnete Restaurants."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8053959-e42e-41b2-b2cd-4124fd97fcad",
                                                "sense_id": "d9acab52-3859-3605-bb42-75b7c17a52f5",
                                                "text": "Dem Nationaltheater zunächst befindet sich eine Galerie."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d9e1ae6d-cd50-45f4-95dd-0d899a7cc9b8",
                        "source_entry_id": "6e0b3577-1afc-3a0b-87b2-4bb225a35e5e",
                        "source_sense_id": "4bf7b25b-d9b7-3c89-9b97-f5bf7a9a3c94",
                        "target_lang_word": "initially",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "initially",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b85b1c20-064d-31cd-bef5-81ddbb17a671",
                                        "entry_id": "d39182c3-17f1-3c6f-83cd-f03009e215e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "At the beginning."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42df5fd7-c6d0-49c8-a220-d3965c419227",
                                                "sense_id": "b85b1c20-064d-31cd-bef5-81ddbb17a671",
                                                "text": "Initially, I found city life incredibly difficult, but now I'm used to it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7127e53f-58fc-4cb9-84f0-d7b84143fe23",
                                                "sense_id": "b85b1c20-064d-31cd-bef5-81ddbb17a671",
                                                "text": "In his submission to the UN, [Christof] Heyns points to the experience of drones. Unmanned aerial vehicles were intended initially only for surveillance, and their use for offensive purposes was prohibited, yet once strategists realised their perceived advantages as a means of carrying out targeted killings, all objections were swept out of the way."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c53cf10c-7266-41d6-8cfb-b542aa1f0f78",
                                                "sense_id": "b85b1c20-064d-31cd-bef5-81ddbb17a671",
                                                "text": "Unsurprisingly, the Group was highly critical of the BTC's organisation and finances, and this prompted Marples to bring forward the Transport Act 1962, which created BR as a standalone entity with its own Board, headed by a full-time chairman. Beeching accepted this latter position, and initially became the BTC chairman in June 1961."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d8687e50-4ec9-457d-b605-d026bcbe2813",
                        "source_entry_id": "6e0b3577-1afc-3a0b-87b2-4bb225a35e5e",
                        "source_sense_id": "4bf7b25b-d9b7-3c89-9b97-f5bf7a9a3c94",
                        "target_lang_word": "at first",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "at first",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c77cded-2566-37fe-8142-620cd48e1ea4",
                                        "entry_id": "52c99269-5db6-32a4-a475-ff570ad2ec3e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Initially; at the start; originally."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a940420a-616d-4ff1-bf9d-bda455bd4485",
                                                "sense_id": "4c77cded-2566-37fe-8142-620cd48e1ea4",
                                                "text": "If at first you don't succeed, try, try again."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66ea4230-535a-496a-a004-b4ad7ee71359",
                                                "sense_id": "4c77cded-2566-37fe-8142-620cd48e1ea4",
                                                "text": "The work was hard at first, but soon I got used to it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71a8c124-1787-4e19-9971-6b19450f82a5",
                                                "sense_id": "4c77cded-2566-37fe-8142-620cd48e1ea4",
                                                "text": "“Well,” I answered, at first with uncertainty, then with inspiration, “he would do splendidly to lead your cotillon, if you think of having one.” ¶ “So you do not dance, Mr. Crocker?” ¶ I was somewhat set back by her perspicuity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d506e39e-580b-4075-97e3-42fae6d47cff",
                                                "sense_id": "4c77cded-2566-37fe-8142-620cd48e1ea4",
                                                "text": "This year of 1905 also saw the completion of the electrification of the Underground, which certainly improved the atmosphere, and made travelling easier and more comfortable, although, at first, not too reliable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9bc049a6-21a3-4d48-a519-a4442f6f2457",
                                                "sense_id": "4c77cded-2566-37fe-8142-620cd48e1ea4",
                                                "text": "At first I was afraid, I was petrified / Kept thinking I could never live without you by my side"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c3c234f-bc82-42b1-a64c-392b6c7022fd",
                                                "sense_id": "4c77cded-2566-37fe-8142-620cd48e1ea4",
                                                "text": "KIRA: Look, Dukat, I know you're angry, but maybe you ought to think about what you're proposing. I mean, you can't go to war against the whole Klingon Empire with one bird of prey.\nDUKAT: Why not? Your people fought against us for fifty years with much less sophisticated weaponry than this. And you beat us.\nKIRA: It's not the same. The Bajoran people were united. We were all fighting for the same goal. You and your crew would be out there alone.\nDUKAT: Maybe at first, but perhaps our actions would inspire others to join the struggle!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7a46fb83-2a9b-4761-9084-1ce0f377e3e8",
                        "source_entry_id": "6e0b3577-1afc-3a0b-87b2-4bb225a35e5e",
                        "source_sense_id": "4bf7b25b-d9b7-3c89-9b97-f5bf7a9a3c94",
